      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate opened 2020 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 3,345.9m. During 2020 there was a modest overall prior-year release of gross reserves of GBP 11.5m (a c.0.34% release). Reserve movements were driven by a mix of factors: COVID-19 losses (gross GBP 229.0m; net GBP 136.0m), adverse development on 2019 large losses (causing a net strengthening in the Reinsurance division of GBP 20.0m), and movements from natural catastrophe events in 2020 (e.g. Hurricanes Laura and Sally, Midwest Derecho, various wildfires and tornados). The net picture across divisions was mixed, with Reinsurance showing net strengthening in 2020 while prior-year releases (including on 2018 & prior large losses) supported improvements recognised in 2019.",
